    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Break:Tutorial_Break_004:34163b8f",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Tutorial_Break",
        "key": "Tutorial_Break_004",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Break:Tutorial_Break_004:34163b8f",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Break:Tutorial_Break_004:34163b8f",
        "jp_sha256": "589c764bd21c1b01a1b55f14ad67ec7980902cead03a8ca41c45bea672873c3d",
        "official_en_sha256": "bea337247479fc0a46920ec3bf264874c20bba9a2693897a0c298f541566a314"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ブレイクゲージを効果的に削るためには\r\n敵の弱点を突くことが重要です。\r\n\r\n攻撃前に、ゲージがどの程度削れるか、予測が表示されます。\r\n敵のブレイクゲージをいかに削るかが、戦略の鍵となります。",
        "official_en": "To effectively reduce an enemy’s stagger gauge,\r\nyou must exploit its weaknesses.\r\n\r\nBefore launching an attack, you will be able to see an estimate of its effect on the stagger gauge.\r\n\r\nBe sure to take this into account to tip the balance\r\nin your favor.",
        "real_en": "To effectively reduce an enemy’s Break gauge,\r\nyou must exploit its weaknesses.\r\n\r\nBefore launching an attack, you will be able to see an estimate of its effect on the Break gauge.\r\n\r\nFinding ways to reduce an enemy’s Break gauge is\r\na key part of your strategy."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "tutorial",
