    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Break:Tutorial_Break_006:d11245c9",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Tutorial_Break",
        "key": "Tutorial_Break_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Break:Tutorial_Break_006:d11245c9",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Break:Tutorial_Break_006:d11245c9",
        "jp_sha256": "834258e4cc4fc7f840381593cc2fcaa0aeef7fda9cae714419878ef09c9cd98f",
        "official_en_sha256": "147ca5e065be809551148cb0deaf2ee74be83d2b7c6c9082e74647026b4f12f0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "技にカーソルを合わせることで\r\nその技のもつ性能や効果を確認することができます。\r\n\r\n剣のマーク　　：物理攻撃の威力を表します。\r\n杖のマーク　　：魔法攻撃の威力を表します。\r\n光のマーク　　：神聖力を参照する魔法攻撃の威力を表します。\r\n十字のマーク　：回復量を表します。\r\n弾丸のマーク　：ブレイクゲージを削る威力を表します。\r\n\r\n技によって、ダメージを出すのが得意な技、\r\nブレイクゲージを削るのが得意な技など特徴があるので\r\n状況に合わせて使い分けていきましょう。",
        "official_en": "Cursoring over a skill will show its description\r\nand effects.\r\n\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Sword symbol:</> Denotes physical damage power.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Staff symbol:</> Denotes magic damage power.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Light ray symbol:</> Denotes power of attacks\r\naffected by the sanctity attribute.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Cross symbol:</> Denotes healing power.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Bullet symbol:</> Denotes stagger power.\r\n\r\nSome attacks deal greater damage, while others\r\nreduce an enemy’s stagger gauge more quickly.\r\nBe sure to use skills that best suit the situation.",
        "real_en": "Cursoring over a skill will show its description\r\nand effects.\r\n\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Sword symbol:</> Denotes physical damage power.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Staff symbol:</> Denotes magic damage power.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Light ray symbol:</> Denotes power of attacks\r\naffected by the sanctity attribute.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Cross symbol:</> Denotes healing power.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Bullet symbol:</> Denotes Break damage.\r\n\r\nSome attacks deal greater damage, while others\r\nreduce an enemy’s Break gauge more quickly.\r\nBe sure to use skills that best suit the situation."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
